Myna GUI
========

Myna GUI preserves and extends code and Git history from:

  myna-sign
  https://github.com/soltia48/myna-sign
  License declared by its Cargo package metadata: MIT

JPKI command names and card workflow are based on the open-source myna project:

  myna
  https://github.com/jpki/myna

Card access uses the myna-card Rust crate:

  myna-card
  https://crates.io/crates/myna-card

Myna GUI is unofficial software. It is not provided, endorsed, or certified by
J-LIS, Japan's Digital Agency, a municipality, or another government body.

